                <mxCell id="init_gh" value="&lt;b&gt;GitHub Actions Setup&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Checkout target repo + Epyon repo&#xa;• Pull Docker images (Trivy, Grype, Syft…)&#xa;• Install deps: jq, bats, Python, syft&#xa;• Free disk space (rm toolchains)&#xa;• Download coverage / SBOM artifact (opt)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
