                <mxCell id="init_web" value="&lt;b&gt;Web UI Initialization (jobs.py)&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;• Parse target (path / git URL / HuggingFace)&#xa;• Derive target_name from URL or path&#xa;• git clone --depth=1 (if remote URL)&#xa;• Create scans/{target_name}_{ts}/ dir&#xa;• Write scan-metadata.json" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
